# AI and MCP Security Assessment Skill

Use this Skill when the target includes LLM, Agent, MCP tools, Skills, RAG, Memory, Plugin, or model-serving components.

**Prerequisite**: If the AI surface is only a presentation layer and the real blocker is still client-side signing or an encrypted protocol, go back to the `client-reverse` Skill first.

